menu "System Services"

    config SF_SYS_MAX_REGISTERED_APPS
        int "Max registered App slots"
        default 16
        range 1 32
        help
            Maximum number of App entries in the static registration table.

    config SF_SYS_MAX_PAUSED_APPS
        int "Max paused (background) Apps"
        default 2
        range 0 8
        help
            How many Apps can stay in PAUSED state simultaneously.
            Beyond this limit, the least-recently-used PAUSED App
            is stopped (STOPPED → DESTROYED).

    config SF_SYS_EVENT_SUBSCRIBERS_PER_EVENT
        int "Max subscribers per Event ID"
        default 8
        range 1 16
        help
            How many callbacks can subscribe to the same Event ID.

endmenu
